WEBVTT

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.800
3 Years Ago

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.920
3 Years Ago
New York, America 
2:00 AM

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:08.770
3 Years Later

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:11.770
3 Years Later
New York, America 
10:40 AM

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:25.280
I doubt that time will ever take 
our pain away completely.

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:30.920
But we must continue to move forward.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:38.160
By moving forward, we create our future.

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:45.900
We will never forget them.

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.500
Even into the future—

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:51.370
No!

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:54.390
We were forgotten.

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.000
She set herself on fire!

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:01.930
Someone bring a fire extinguisher, quick!

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:05.060
The fire... Put out the fire!

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:58.890
All of you forgot

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.920
about those who died in the Reflection...

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:03.850
About those who survived.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:07.800
You didn't care to know about 
their helplessness or suffering.

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:12.280
You just stand there with your eyes 
closed, producing fake tears.

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:16.170
In that case, we, the Reflected,

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:18.630
will force you to open your eyes.

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:21.720
My comrades around the world,

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:26.400
now is the time to remind the 
world of our existence!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.960
<i>That's more like it.</i>

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:49.670
<i>Of course he showed up.</i>

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:53.870
<i>Beta, Gamma, Delta... Regroup with Alpha.</i>

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:58.080
<i>Alpha, capture X-On and 
wait for the other three.</i>

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:01.950
<i>Once everyone regroups, attack him 
all at once and cause a scene.</i>

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:08.760
<i>Alpha, come in. I can't link 
to your thoughts. Alpha...</i>

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:37.330
What? He has someone with him?

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:40.280
<i>Unleash them. All of them!</i>

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:27.390
<i>Our plan has been thwarted.</i>

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:29.240
<i>That's not true.</i>

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:32.800
<i>If the star refuses to come 
out of the dressing room,</i>

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.400
<i>someone else will have to go on.</i>

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:42.580
<i>He won over the crowd in an instant.</i>

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:46.230
<i>Drawing attention is good...</i>

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.470
<i>But he's drawing too much attention.</i>

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.020
There they are.

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:56.730
Um...

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:02.100
A mysterious hero hides in the 
back alleys of New York City?

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.600
Brutal criminals were knocked out... 
But by whom?

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:07.100
The situation in NY is critical

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:15.110
Maybe they'll show up at 
the memorial ceremony?!

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:15.110
Or maybe that's a trap??

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:19.610
I also knew

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:23.010
that this was a trap to lure me out.

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:26.620
I have a busybody who tells me these things.

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:31.390
But once I knew that, I had no choice 
but to make an appearance.

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:33.930
Talk about annoying.

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.380
Um, I...

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:38.530
Yeah, you've really done your research.

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:40.510
You're headed in the right direction.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.010
And...

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:43.510
Your power is

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:46.730
truly unique, as well.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:49.460
Now, then... Where should we go?

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:51.670
Can you phase through things?

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:55.020
You're going to capture me faster 
than the speed of light, right?

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:59.410
U-Um, I...

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:00.530
Wraith.

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:04.980
Um...

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:07.090
Thank goodness.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.910
I'm so relieved that you're

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:11.660
just some stalker.

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:12.570
Huh?

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:15.300
Ow!

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:19.820
I guess you can't control your 
powers very well yet.

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:21.010
That's why...

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:23.010
Please make me your student!

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:25.530
I...

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:27.110
Three years ago, on that day,

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:30.000
I encountered the Reflection and survived.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.020
And then, I had powers...

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:37.220
I was bullied in school,

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:39.650
and I had nowhere to go.

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:43.250
So I've been running all this time.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:47.780
I might have received these powers 
so I can keep running, too.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:49.890
That's what I thought...

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:53.290
But there's nowhere I can go.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.810
They aren't taking me anywhere.

00:10:56.430 --> 00:10:59.300
I didn't know what to do anymore...

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:01.180
And that's when

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:04.460
I found out about you, X-On!

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:06.300
You're the same way, aren't you?

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:09.100
You gained powers from the Reflection.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.610
I thought that you were using your powers

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:14.760
for good, without any hesitation.

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:17.940
You knew the meaning of power.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:22.330
And, um... I thought you were a decent person.

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:26.920
I... I'm sorry.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:29.500
I want you to tell me

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.130
exactly what my powers are.

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:36.000
Why I was allowed to live 
and given these powers...

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:41.180
And how I can make the best of 
my powers, just like you do.

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:44.770
I... I don't want to run away anymore!

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:45.700
So...

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:48.500
So you want to depend on someone else.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:49.340
Huh?

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:50.570
Sorry.

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:52.320
I'm not feeling it.

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:54.640
I tried to, though.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:12:00.670
But I really do want you to stop stalking me.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.500
How about this?

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:05.390
Why don't you change the 
direction of your interest?

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:07.950
Maybe...

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:09.740
to Wraith.

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:10.740
Huh?

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:13.240
Who's Wraith?

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:18.210
You were able to find out this much about me, 
so you might be able to figure that out.

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:36.030
Wraith...

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:46.950
<i>Our flight will be arriving shortly at 
Los Angeles International Airport.</i>

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:50.240
<i>Please make sure your seatbelts 
are securely fastened.</i>

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:56.330
<i>Please refrain from using 
the lavatories at this time.</i>

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:46.040
Yay!

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.620
Stop getting all giddy like little kids.

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:56.480
Hurry up and get our big 
star out of that tin suit!

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:07.270
Good work.

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:14.260
You did it, Ian! That was a fantastic debut!

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:20.340
But it was pretty nerve-wracking.

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:25.760
It was just like going on stage to 
sing without any rehearsal.

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:29.850
No kidding.

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:37.660
I-Ian!

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:03.120
<i>Ian, you're getting farther and 
farther from Times Square!</i>

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:07.800
I've got some bat and frog on me, 
and I can't move freely!

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.640
<i>Use your thrusters!</i>

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:11.810
<i>Damn it. This isn't good.</i>

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:13.850
<i>You're heading right!</i>

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.410
<i>You're gonna hit that building!</i>

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:16.850
Wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.710
<i>Are you all right, Ian?</i>

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:23.150
Yeah, more or less.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.100
Whoa, there.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.310
Crap!

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:34.360
Miss,

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:36.480
everything is okay now.

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:40.800
<i>You'd better not be hitting on her.</i>

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:43.970
Like I could in this situation!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.160
Hey, come on!

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:52.590
And we were just getting to know each other...

00:15:54.610 --> 00:15:57.270
But I guess this is goodbye.

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:13.110
Aaron, I want to get back to Times 
Square. Navigate me there.

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:17.360
Actually, why don't you fly up?

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:20.410
<i>But then the audience won't 
be able to see me well.</i>

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:21.860
He's right.

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.230
He has to charm the people...

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:25.690
...for it to be entertainment.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:27.030
You idiots!

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:29.130
Fighting is a matter of life or death!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:32.880
It's because it's a matter of life or death 
that we want to present it beautifully.

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:35.200
You guys are nuts.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:37.760
<i>It's "Sky Show" time!</i>

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.390
Don't do that song!

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:40.840
Ian!

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:42.460
Take a right there!

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:44.190
Now left!

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:47.530
A-camera, B-camera, C-camera, D-camera.

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:49.610
Projection mapping is running!

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.520
We're doing this from LA, 
so sorry for any errors.

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:54.660
Nope. We have to do this perfectly.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.490
<i>C-camera, correct any errors.</i>

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.690
<i>This is surreal, which is pretty cool, too.</i>

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.120
<i>Come on, shape things up.</i>

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:09.580
<i>Ian, that frog bastard is coming from below.</i>

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.170
<i>Get the timing just right.</i>

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.890
That's good! I'm feeling it!

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:31.840
You all right?

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:36.840
If you push your body that far, 
of course it's going to fight back.

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:39.660
Three years, huh?

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:47.400
That incident three years ago might 
have made me the man I am now...

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.050
3 Years Ago

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:56.550
3 Years Ago
Los Angeles, America 
11:00 PM

00:17:56.550 --> 00:18:01.790
True, "Sky Show" is one of the 
biggest hits of the 80s,

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:04.890
but it was the only hit from that album.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:08.310
That guy is totally a one-hit wonder.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:13.710
But that one-hit wonder was huge. 
That song is an oldie in America now,

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:15.810
but it's still selling in Europe.

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:19.370
It's used in commercials, 
especially in Germany,

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:23.090
and covers sell even more 
than the original did.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:25.750
And because of those insane royalties,

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:29.350
we're able to have these 
crazy parties every night.

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:30.710
It's pretty impressive.

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:32.290
Yeah.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:36.430
We're really blessed to get to enjoy 
all this delicious food and drink.

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:38.590
And it's all because of "Sky Show."

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:41.060
Sky Show...

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:44.390
Whoops.

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:50.600
Amazing how he can get so 
wasted on such a light Scotch

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.190
that's been thinned down 
even more with water.

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.980
Despite being a hit in America,

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:57.900
I'm sure he wants to remind us that he's British.

00:18:58.230 --> 00:18:59.850
What is that?

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:21.680
Somehow, I survived being 
enveloped in that light.

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:27.000
And I ended up gaining an incredible power.

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:31.190
Because of that damned fantastic power,

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:34.140
I had to give up being a singer.

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:37.590
But I have to say

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:39.450
that I'm satisfied.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:44.540
Because now I'm able to stand 
on a new stage, as a hero.

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:48.920
So, how'd it feel to be back in 
the spotlight after so long?

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.160
Indescribable!

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:06.590
Come on, bring it on!

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:08.470
This ain't nowhere near enough!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:11.720
Guts! You gotta have more guts than that!

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:19.900
Now that's gutsy.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:27.670
Guts, guts, guts, guts, guts!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:39.720
Mr. I-Guy,

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:44.290
will you continue to protect 
the Los Angeles area?

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.670
I love LA!

00:20:47.620 --> 00:21:00.730
I-Guy! I-Guy! I-Guy! I-Guy! I-Guy! I-Guy!

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:02.410
They're making their move...

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:08.700
The Reflected who were hit by the smoke 
have a strong tendency to become criminals.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:13.860
If we can get that hero with the 
mohawk to work his hardest,

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:18.000
we should be able to find more Reflected.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:20.820
And then, we'll take them.

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:23.500
Our master has said

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.600
that we still need more.

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:28.410
More... More...

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:50.360
What am I supposed to find just by 
searching for the word "Wraith"?

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:02.940
If Wraith was also a Reflected...

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:10.960
I'm in!

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:18.730
Could they be somewhere in here?

00:22:39.990 --> 00:22:43.000
Did you see that terrorist attack 
in America the other day?

00:22:43.270 --> 00:22:44.520
The one where monsters showed up?

00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:47.260
Yeah! Wasn't that super creepy?

00:22:47.260 --> 00:22:48.630
What? It was super cool.

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:50.340
It was so scary!

00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:51.190
<i>Monsters...</i>

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:53.370
The same kind of thing is 
happening in Japan, too.

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:55.150
Girls, did you think of something?

00:22:55.520 --> 00:22:56.270
Yeah.

00:22:56.270 --> 00:22:57.780
But of course!

00:22:58.220 --> 00:22:59.770
It's a bit embarrassing, but...

00:23:00.770 --> 00:23:04.780
Pom

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:03.670
Well...

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:04.760
Let's decide.

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:07.980
On our team name.

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Next Time 
Lisa

00:24:48.210 --> 00:24:55.010
Narration: Stan Lee
